{"slides": [{"number": 1, "title": "音声からスライド動画を作る流れ", "timestamp_start": 0, "timestamp_end": 16, "segment_ids": [], "speakers_words": "今日は、音声からスライド動画を作る流れを確認します。大事なポイントは三つあります。", "keywords": ["音声", "スライド動画", "流れ"], "visual_role": "導入タイトル", "main_visual": "大きなタイトルと流れの図", "energy_level": "medium"}, {"number": 2, "title": "日本語の読みやすさと復元確認", "timestamp_start": 16, "timestamp_end": 32, "segment_ids": [], "speakers_words": "日本語が読みやすく、余白が詰まりすぎていないこと。保存して、あとから復元できることも確認します。", "keywords": ["日本語", "読みやすさ", "復元"], "visual_role": "確認ポイント", "main_visual": "3つのチェックカード", "energy_level": "medium"}], "strategy": {"content_analysis": {"core_message": "音声入力からスライド動画を生成するVoiSlideの品質を評価する", "emotional_tone": "クリーン、プロフェッショナル、技術的で信頼感のある", "key_concepts": ["音声認識", "スライド生成", "日本語品質", "ワークフロー", "評価"], "target_audience": "プロダクト開発者、品質評価担当者、技術マネージャー"}, "design_style": {"concept_name": "Clear Voice Architecture", "concept_description": "日本語の可読性を最優先にしたミニマルでテクニカルなデザイン。十分な余白と明確なタイポグラフィで、情報の構造を視覚的に整理。音声の波形をモチーフにした控えめなビジュアル要素で技術的な文脈を演出する。", "color_palette": {"primary": "#2563EB", "secondary": "#0EA5E9", "accent": "#F59E0B", "background_start": "#0F172A", "background_end": "#1E293B"}, "typography_direction": "タイトルは太めのゴシック体で堂々と、本文は読みやすい中量級のサンセリフ。日本語は語の途中で改行させず、単語単位で自然に折り返す。文字間と行間にゆとりを持たせ、視認性を最大化。", "visual_theme": "音声波形を想起させる水平ライン、幾何学的なグリッド構造、洗練されたカードレイアウト。余白を活かしながらも画面端まで要素を配置し、空間を有効活用する。"}, "_design_mode": "flash_standard"}, "html_contents": ["<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<title>音声からスライド動画を作る流れ</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    width: 1920px; height: 1080px;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E293B 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: 80px !important;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .bg-orb-1 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -200px; right: -200px;\n    width: 780px; height: 780px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.28) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    filter: blur(40px);\n  }\n  .bg-orb-2 {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: -250px; left: -150px;\n    width: 680px; height: 680px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.22) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    filter: blur(40px);\n  }\n  .bg-orb-3 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 28%; left: 8%;\n    width: 340px; height: 340px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.14) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    filter: blur(30px);\n  }\n\n  .wave-lines {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%; left: 0; right: 0;\n    height: 2px;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    opacity: 0.1;\n  }\n  .wave-lines::before, .wave-lines::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0; right: 0;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #2563EB, #0EA5E9, transparent);\n  }\n  .wave-lines::before { top: -220px; }\n  .wave-lines::after { top: 220px; }\n\n  .grid-overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 80px 80px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .waveform {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 56px;\n    height: 80px;\n  }\n  .waveform span {\n    display: block;\n    width: 8px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2563EB, #0EA5E9);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.4);\n  }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(1) { height: 26px; }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(2) { height: 52px; }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(3) { height: 74px; }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(4) { height: 44px; }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(5) { height: 64px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0EA5E9, #F59E0B); }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(6) { height: 32px; background: #F59E0B; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.6); }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(7) { height: 58px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F59E0B, #0EA5E9); }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(8) { height: 74px; }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(9) { height: 38px; }\n  .waveform span:nth-child(10) { height: 22px; }\n\n  .hero {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 10;\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 1680px;\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.32em;\n    color: #22D3EE;\n    margin-bottom: 48px;\n    padding: 14px 32px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.45);\n    border-radius: 100px;\n    background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n  }\n  .eyebrow::before, .eyebrow::after {\n    content: '';\n    width: 10px; height: 10px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #F59E0B;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 22px #F59E0B;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 128px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    white-space: normal;\n    overflow: visible;\n    max-width: 92%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FFFFFF 38%, #22D3EE 72%, #FBBF24 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);\n    overflow-wrap: normal;\n    word-break: keep-all;\n    line-break: strict;\n    text-wrap: balance;\n  }\n\n  .underline {\n    margin: 64px auto 0;\n    width: 280px;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #2563EB, #F59E0B, transparent);\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .meta-info {\n    margin-top: 36px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n    letter-spacing: 0.32em;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .slide-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 50px; right: 60px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n    letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .slide-number strong {\n    color: #F59E0B;\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .corner {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 70px; height: 70px;\n    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.55);\n  }\n  .corner-tl { top: 50px; left: 50px; border-top: 2px solid; border-left: 2px solid; }\n  .corner-br { bottom: 50px; right: 50px; border-bottom: 2px solid; border-right: 2px solid; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"bg-orb-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"bg-orb-2\"></div>\n<div class=\"bg-orb-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"grid-overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-lines\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-tl\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner corner-br\"></div>\n<div class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">VOICE  →  SLIDE  →  VIDEO</div>\n<div class=\"waveform\">\n<span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n<span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n</div>\n<h1>音声からスライド動画を作る流れ</h1>\n<div class=\"underline\"></div>\n<div class=\"meta-info\">WORKFLOW  OVERVIEW</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slide-number\"><strong>01</strong>  /  02</div>\n</body>\n</html>", "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<title>日本語の読みやすさと復元確認</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  \n  body {\n    width: 1920px;\n    height: 1080px;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E293B 100%);\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 80px 120px !important;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  /* 音声波形モチーフ */\n  .wave-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3) 20%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.5) 50%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3) 80%, transparent 100%);\n  }\n  .wave-1 { top: 18%; }\n  .wave-2 { top: 82%; }\n\n  /* 波形バー装飾 */\n  .wave-bars {\n    position: absolute;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    height: 80px;\n  }\n  .wave-bars.top { top: 130px; left: 120px; }\n  .wave-bars.bottom { bottom: 130px; right: 120px; }\n\n  .wave-bars span {\n    display: block;\n    width: 5px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2563EB, #0EA5E9);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.4);\n  }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(1) { height: 20%; }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(2) { height: 55%; }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(3) { height: 80%; }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(4) { height: 100%; }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(5) { height: 65%; }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(6) { height: 40%; }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(7) { height: 75%; }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(8) { height: 50%; }\n  .wave-bars span:nth-child(9) { height: 25%; }\n\n  /* グラデーション円 */\n  .glow {\n    position: absolute;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    filter: blur(140px);\n    opacity: 0.35;\n  }\n  .glow-1 {\n    width: 650px; height: 650px;\n    background: #2563EB;\n    top: -220px; right: -170px;\n  }\n  .glow-2 {\n    width: 550px; height: 550px;\n    background: #F59E0B;\n    bottom: -200px; left: -140px;\n    opacity: 0.22;\n  }\n  .glow-3 {\n    width: 400px; height: 400px;\n    background: #0EA5E9;\n    top: 40%; left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    opacity: 0.15;\n  }\n\n  /* メインコンテンツ */\n  .eyebrow {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5em;\n    color: #FBBF24;\n    margin-bottom: 70px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    z-index: 10;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow::before,\n  .eyebrow::after {\n    content: '';\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 2px;\n    background: #FBBF24;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    margin: 0 32px;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 132px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #06B6D4 50%, #FBBF24 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    \n    max-width: 92%;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    z-index: 10;\n    position: relative;\n    white-space: normal;\n    overflow: visible;\n    overflow-wrap: normal;\n    word-break: keep-all;\n    line-break: strict;\n    text-wrap: balance;\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 30px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15));\n  }\n\n  .divider {\n    width: 160px;\n    height: 5px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563EB, #0EA5E9, #F59E0B);\n    margin-top: 90px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    z-index: 10;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.5);\n  }\n\n  /* スライド番号 */\n  .slide-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 60px;\n    right: 80px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);\n    letter-spacing: 0.25em;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n\n  .brand {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 58px;\n    left: 80px;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);\n    letter-spacing: 0.35em;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .brand::before {\n    content: '';\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 10px;\n    background: #0EA5E9;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    margin-right: 16px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 14px #0EA5E9;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"glow glow-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"glow glow-2\"></div>\n<div class=\"glow glow-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-line wave-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-line wave-2\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bars top\">\n<span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n<span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wave-bars bottom\">\n<span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n<span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Verification</div>\n<h1>日本語の読みやすさと<br/>復元確認</h1>\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n<div class=\"brand\">CLEAR VOICE</div>\n<div class=\"slide-number\">02 / 02</div>\n</body>\n</html>"], "design_quality_metrics": [{"min_font_size_px": 128.0, "title_font_size_px": 128.0, "body_font_size_px_min": 128.0, "main_element_occupancy_ratio": null, "blank_area_ratio_estimate": null, "text_clipping_detected": false, "small_text_count": 0, "fallback_used": false, "quality_gate": "pass", "warnings": [], "slide_number": 1}, {"min_font_size_px": 132.0, "title_font_size_px": 132.0, "body_font_size_px_min": 132.0, "main_element_occupancy_ratio": 0.000868, "blank_area_ratio_estimate": 0.999132, "text_clipping_detected": false, "small_text_count": 0, "fallback_used": false, "quality_gate": "warn", "warnings": ["主役要素の画面占有率が0.00です。目標は0.30以上です。"], "slide_number": 2}]}